  "findings": [
    "Root reviewed all20 contact pages. Sampled idle lighting follows the source closely. Coarser mantle/hem folds, trim and fine surface detail differences remain, especially rear views.",
    "Fixed walk18/idle48 blend progression shows no obvious new skin patches or collapsed limbs in these sampled views. Matching weights in reverse directions are pixel-identical for all20 pairs.",
    "IdleOff controls phase and palette brightness; transient review MIDs compensate brightness with BaseColor reciprocal and readback, after asserting PaletteMix/SkinVariation=0. This is a comparison control, not a production material change.",
    "Commandlet world time asserted zero around every capture. Source endpoint references exist, but intermediate shader vertex blends do not have skeletal blend references. This does not prove continuously advancing clips, loop seams or transition clearance.",
    "All8 native jobs exited0. Seven wrapper successes and one reconciled output-discovery failure; original failure receipt preserved. No asset saves or runtime adoption."
  ],
